  "headline": "President Subianto To Select New Vice President After State Visits",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo To Select New Vice President",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto plans to appoint a successor for Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka following his state visits to China and the Philippines.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto intends to begin the search for a new vice president after concluding his state visits to China and the Philippines.",
    "The President has requested coalition parties to prepare potential candidates for the position within a one-week timeframe.",
    "While some political parties have proposed specific names or expressed support for internal candidates, others have deferred the decision entirely to the President."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian political landscape is currently focused on the succession of Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka. Following recent meetings, President Prabowo Subianto has instructed supporting political coalition parties to submit their nominations for a new vice president within one week. Several parties have publicly responded to this directive, with some presenting lists of potential candidates, while others, such as the National Mandate Party (PAN), have chosen not to nominate individuals, instead leaving the final selection to the discretion of the President. Discussions have also emerged regarding the role of the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) in overseeing this administrative process. President Subianto stated he would address the selection upon returning from his official diplomatic travels to Manila and Shenzhen. The search for a successor remains a significant topic of national discourse among coalition members and stakeholders.",
